###  http://bdi.si.ehu.es/bdi/ontologies/TrhOnt#DrugDose
TrhOnt:DrugDose rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:intersectionOf ( [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
